{"id": "aafd74eb-f32f-4b73-ba21-d928ea183590", "slug": "agency-deck-interaction", "title": "Agency Deck Interaction", "description": "Agency Deck Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Agency Deck Interaction\"\ndescription: \"Agency Deck Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF791F\"\n  secondary: \"#E13B36\"\n  accent: \"#E13B36\"\n  background: \"#F9F8F4\"\n  surface: \"#8B5A44\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#2D2A26\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Agency Deck Interaction\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 57; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: section, animated, cta, bento, presentation, branding.\n## Overview\nAgency Deck Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nScroll down to explore What we ship. Our ways to move fast. Investor-proof decks that raise faster. 04 \"The pitch deck they created was a game-changer. We closed our seed round in under three weeks. Absolute precision i…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: What we ship. Our ways to move fast.; Investor-proof decks that raise faster.; Web Design for growing teams & business.; Product experiences users adopt & keep using.; Branding that drives conversion & funding..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF791F, secondary #E13B36, accent #E13B36, background #F9F8F4, surface #8B5A44, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agency Deck Interaction</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: auto;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            overscroll-behavior: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom utilities to keep HTML clean */\n        .perspective-container {\n            perspective: 3200px;\n            perspective-origin: 50% 36%;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            transform: translateZ(0);\n            overflow: visible;\n        }\n\n        .card-panel {\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            backface-visibility: hidden;\n            transform-origin: 50% 0%;\n            will-change: transform, filter;\n            transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n        }\n\n        .card-panel::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n        }\n\n        .masked-line {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .masked-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body\n    class=\"bg-[#F9F8F4] text-neutral-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-neutral-900 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Hero / Intro Spacer -->\n    <div class=\"h-[40vh] flex items-end justify-center pb-12\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400\">Scroll down to explore</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Pinned Deck Section - reverse pull-up deck animation -->\n    <section id=\"deck-section\"\n        class=\"min-h-screen w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-12 relative overflow-visible\">\n\n        <!-- Masked Headline -->\n        <div class=\"w-full px-4 text-center z-10 mb-10 md:mb-20 relative pointer-events-none\">\n            <h1\n                class=\"header-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 leading-[1.1]\">\n                <span class=\"masked-line\">\n                    <span class=\"masked-word\">What</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">we</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">ship.</span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"masked-line\">\n                    <span class=\"masked-word\">Our</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">ways</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">to</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">move</span>\n                <span class=\"masked-word\">fast.</span>\n                </span>\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3D Card Stack Container -->\n        <div\n            class=\"perspective-container relative z-20 w-[92vw] max-w-[1200px] aspect-[3/4] md:aspect-[21/10] min-h-[600px] md:min-h-[500px] mt-4 md:mt-8\">\n\n            <!-- Card 4 (Bottom of stack) -->\n            <div\n                class=\"deck-card card-panel absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#8B5A44] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl text-white origin-[50%_120%]\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-lg leading-tight\">\n                        Investor-proof decks that raise faster.</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight opacity-70\">04</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 h-full items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[35%] flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\">\n                        <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-90\">\n                            \"The pitch deck they created was a game-changer. We closed our seed round in under three\n                            weeks. Absolute precision in their storytelling.\"\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Sarah Jenkins</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">CEO @Lumina Health</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[65%] grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 h-full relative\">\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#F4EBE1] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-6 text-neutral-900\">\n                                <span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold italic\">Series A</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent hidden md:block\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#D9C5B2] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-16 h-4 bg-[#8B5A44]/40 rounded-full mb-2\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end w-full mt-8 md:mt-0 relative\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"\n                        class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase transition-transform hover:scale-105 shadow-sm\">\n                        SEE OUR CASE STUDIES <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"\n                            stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3 -->\n            <div\n                class=\"deck-card card-panel absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#E13B36] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl text-white origin-[50%_120%]\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-lg leading-tight\">Web\n                        Design for growing teams & business.</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight opacity-70\">03</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 h-full items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[35%] flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\">\n                        <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-90\">\n                            \"A massive upgrade to our digital presence. The new site is fast, scalable, and beautifully\n                            reflects our evolved brand identity.\"\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-linear\" width=\"20\"\n                                    class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Marcus Thorne</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">VP Marketing @Nexus</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[65%] grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 h-full relative\">\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-neutral-900 rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-[#E13B36]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-white/10 rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tighter\">N.</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent hidden md:block\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#2A2A2A] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 w-full max-w-[60px]\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-6 bg-white/20 rounded\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-6 bg-white/20 rounded\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-6 bg-white/20 rounded\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-6 bg-white/20 rounded\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end w-full mt-8 md:mt-0 relative\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"\n                        class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase transition-transform hover:scale-105 shadow-sm\">\n                        SEE OUR CASE STUDIES <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"\n                            stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <div\n                class=\"deck-card card-panel absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#FF791F] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl text-white origin-[50%_120%]\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-lg leading-tight\">\n                        Product experiences users adopt & keep using.</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight opacity-70\">02</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 h-full items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[35%] flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\">\n                        <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-90\">\n                            \"A huge thank you to the entire team for your outstanding work on our app interface.\n                            Retention is up, and friction is practically gone.\"\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ghost-smile-linear\" width=\"20\"\n                                    class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Théo Cesarini</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">CEO & Co-Founder @Incard</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[65%] grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 h-full relative\">\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent col-span-2\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#F5F2ED] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-6 text-neutral-900 overflow-hidden relative\">\n                                <div\n                                    class=\"absolute inset-x-4 bottom-0 top-8 bg-white rounded-t-xl shadow-lg border border-neutral-100 flex p-3 gap-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1/3 h-full bg-neutral-100 rounded-lg\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-2/3 h-full bg-neutral-50 rounded-lg\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#2D2A26] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-10px] w-20 h-24 bg-[#FF791F] rounded-t-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent hidden md:block\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end w-full mt-8 md:mt-0 relative\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"\n                        class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase transition-transform hover:scale-105 shadow-sm\">\n                        SEE OUR CASE STUDIES <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"\n                            stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 1 (Top of stack) -->\n            <div\n                class=\"deck-card card-panel absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] bg-[#4334C7] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl text-white origin-[50%_120%] ring-1 ring-white/10 ring-inset\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-lg leading-tight\">\n                        Branding that drives conversion & funding.</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium tracking-tight opacity-70\">01</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 h-full items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[35%] flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center\">\n                        <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-90\">\n                            \"Working with this team has been an absolute pleasure. Beyond their creativity and\n                            professionalism, there's a real sense of kindness and care in everything they do.\"\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-id-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Jérémy Bendayan</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs opacity-70\">Co-founder & COO @Jaws Group</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full md:w-[65%] grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 h-full relative\">\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#D1F74A] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[80%] h-[40%] bg-black rounded-lg transform -skew-x-12\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#E4C8A7] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4 text-center\">\n                                <span class=\"font-serif text-[#8C6D46] font-semibold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase leading-tight\">Important<br>House</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent hidden md:block\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#E9F3A1] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <span class=\"font-serif text-[#164817] font-semibold text-5xl italic tracking-tighter\">2o</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 to-transparent hidden md:block\">\n                            <div\n                                class=\"bg-[#9E2010] rounded-2xl h-full min-h-[140px] flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#FF6A13] transform rotate-45 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end w-full mt-8 md:mt-0 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"relative group\">\n                        <a href=\"#\"\n                            class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase transition-transform hover:scale-105 shadow-sm relative z-10\">\n                            SEE OUR CASE STUDIES <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"\n                                stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </a>\n                        <!-- Playful oversized cursor icon matching agency style -->\n                        <svg class=\"absolute -bottom-8 -right-6 w-10 h-10 z-50 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-xl -rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-90 group-hover:-rotate-0\"\n                            viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M7 3L23.4 15.6L15.6 18.2L20.8 26L17.2 28.2L12 20.4L6 25V3Z\" fill=\"black\"\n                                stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Outro Spacer -->\n    <div class=\"h-screen bg-[#F9F8F4] flex items-center justify-center\">\n        <p class=\"text-neutral-400 font-medium\">Continue scrolling...</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Helps ScrollTrigger recalculate correctly after fonts/icons finish loading.\n            window.addEventListener(\"load\", () => ScrollTrigger.refresh());\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal Animation\n            const words = gsap.utils.toArray(\".masked-word\");\n            gsap.to(words, {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.1,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".header-reveal\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 2. Smooth Scroll-Driven 3D Card Stack\n            // Reverse pull-up behavior:\n            // Each active card is pulled from the bottom edge, folds upward,\n            // travels to the top of the viewport, then disappears to reveal the next card.\n            // DOM order is bottom to top in the HTML, so we reverse it.\n            // cards[0] = visible top card, cards[1] = second card, etc.\n            const cards = gsap.utils.toArray(\".deck-card\").reverse();\n            const totalCards = cards.length;\n            const STACK_OFFSET = 34;\n            const STACK_SCALE = 0.035;\n\n            gsap.set(\".perspective-container\", {\n                transformPerspective: 2600,\n                transformStyle: \"preserve-3d\"\n            });\n\n            cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                gsap.set(card, {\n                    y: index * STACK_OFFSET,\n                    z: -index * 18,\n                    scale: 1 - index * STACK_SCALE,\n                    rotationX: 0,\n                    rotationY: 0,\n                    rotationZ: 0,\n                    autoAlpha: 1,\n                    zIndex: totalCards - index,\n                    transformOrigin: \"50% 0%\",\n                    transformStyle: \"preserve-3d\",\n                    force3D: true\n                });\n            });\n\n            const deckTl = gsap.timeline({\n                defaults: {\n                    ease: \"none\",\n                    overwrite: \"auto\"\n                },\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#deck-section\",\n                    start: \"center center\",\n                    end: () => \"+=\" + window.innerHeight * 4.8,\n                    scrub: 0.85,\n                    pin: true,\n                    anticipatePin: 1,\n                    invalidateOnRefresh: true,\n                    fastScrollEnd: false\n                }\n            });\n\n            cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                if (index === totalCards - 1) return;\n\n                const cardsUnder = cards.slice(index + 1);\n                const holdLabel = `hold-${index}`;\n                const openLabel = `open-${index}`;\n                const settleLabel = `settle-${index}`;\n\n                // Keep the current card readable for a moment before it opens.\n                deckTl.addLabel(holdLabel);\n                deckTl.to({}, { duration: 0.28 });\n\n                deckTl.addLabel(openLabel);\n\n                // Important fix:\n                // The active card now stays visually ABOVE the stack while it opens.\n                // Before, it moved backward on the Z axis and the next card could cut through it.\n                // This feels more like a real book cover/page being lifted from the bottom.\n                deckTl.set(card, {\n                    zIndex: totalCards + 10,\n                    transformOrigin: \"50% 0%\"\n                }, openLabel);\n\n                deckTl.to(card, {\n                    rotationX: 82,\n                    rotationZ: index % 2 === 0 ? -1.6 : 1.6,\n                    y: -250,\n                    z: 230,\n                    scale: 0.985,\n                    duration: 1.35,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n                }, openLabel);\n\n                // Inner content has a tiny delayed lift, like the card surface has depth.\n                deckTl.to(card.querySelectorAll(\"h2, p, .grid, a\"), {\n                    y: -18,\n                    z: 42,\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n                }, openLabel + \"+=0.08\");\n\n                // The stack underneath rises only after the top card starts clearing it.\n                // This prevents the next card from slicing through the active card.\n                cardsUnder.forEach((underCard, underIndex) => {\n                    deckTl.to(underCard, {\n                        y: underIndex * STACK_OFFSET,\n                        z: -underIndex * 18,\n                        scale: 1 - underIndex * STACK_SCALE,\n                        duration: 1.05,\n                        ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n                    }, openLabel + \"+=0.28\");\n                });\n\n                // Let the lifted card travel out naturally, then fade only at the very end.\n                deckTl.addLabel(settleLabel, \">\");\n                deckTl.to(card, {\n                    rotationX: 96,\n                    y: -360,\n                    z: 260,\n                    autoAlpha: 0,\n                    duration: 0.42,\n                    ease: \"sine.out\",\n                    onComplete: () => gsap.set(card, { zIndex: 0, pointerEvents: \"none\" }),\n                    onReverseComplete: () => gsap.set(card, { zIndex: totalCards - index, pointerEvents: \"auto\" })\n                }, settleLabel);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "agency-deck-interaction.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/agency-deck-interaction.jpg", "source_name": "agency-deck-interaction-DESIGN.md", "views": 164, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:28:02.42583+00:00"}